# hypr.local.conf — device-specific Hyprland overlay, NOT committed.
# [D-MOUSE-ACCEL][D-SECRETS-LOCAL]
# Copy to ~/.config/dotfiles/hypr.local.conf, then re-run ./install so the
# installer adds a `source = ` line for it to ~/.config/hypr/hyprland.conf.
#
# Example: speed up an external mouse (e.g. Logitech MX Master). Find the exact
# device name with `hyprctl devices`, then set per-device input:
#
# device {
#   name = <name-from-hyprctl-devices>
#   sensitivity = 0.6
# }
